  <name>Steward</name>
  <summary>Manage your Snaps</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Steward lists the snaps installed on your system and lets you review and
    manage each snap's path permissions (AppArmor prompting rules). You can
    add a read permission for a specific path by typing or pasting a pattern,
    and remove rules you no longer want.</p>
  </description>
